    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +9 and ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of performing a critical hit, chance of evading enemy's\nattack & damage reduction rate 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- \"Bond of Master and Disciple\" or \"Future Saga\" Category allies'\nATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Randomly changes Ki Spheres of a certain Type (AGL & INT\nexcluded) to Rainbow Ki Spheres\n*When activating the Active Skill or when attacking with 18 or more Ki*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- Chance of performing a critical hit & chance of evading enemy's\nattack 50%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Survives K.O. attacks (up to once within a turn)\n*When attacking as the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- Launches 2 additional attacks, each of which has a high chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n*When there is another \"Bond of Master and Disciple\" or \"Future Saga\"\nCategory ally on the team*\n- ATK & DEF 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- {passiveImg:once}{passiveImg:forever}All allies' DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g} when HP is 30% or less\nafter receiving an attack\n- Recovers 15% HP at the end of turn after receiving an attack",
